1" /><zone xml:id="m-8a39062c-b565-4379-a3f2-bb67bbeb535f" ulx="55" uly="897" lrx="926" lry="932" /><zone xml:id="m-85acf987-019f-4720-8a5b-2632a236cd42" ulx="46" uly="929" lrx="479" lry="964" /><zone xml:id="m-6e40e492-6ee0-44ea-bf7c-3322e21d28cd" ulx="489" uly="931" lrx="929" lry="965" /><zone xml:id="m-440dfb41-8d7a-4c85-ba8a-2467ef393153" ulx="489" uly="952" lrx="795" lry="987" /><zone xml:id="m-7afefa6d-5dd5-4d88-8ec2-ca5f3d4fc2bd" ulx="38" uly="954" lrx="480" lry="988" /><zone xml:id="m-cbc921da-9228-41f4-a967-b0e6b64507c2" ulx="39" uly="981" lrx="486" lry="1024" /><zone xml:id="m-454452ea-6708-40cf-864f-673ff6d3f9c0" ulx="63" uly="1025" lrx="551" lry="1068" /><zone xml:id="m-30b307dc-b874-4fe9-8f48-2f940c2b9cb2" ulx="433" uly="1080" lrx="534" lry="1114" /><zone xml:id="m-2bd5dcbe-9c2a-4206-89e7-28f1e1579406" ulx="57" uly="1117" lrx="923" lry="1163" /><zone xml:id="m-27683250-8de0-4609-b688-c0db788a8c14" ulx="43" uly="1154" lrx="852" lry="1191" /><zone xml:id="m-44f8dc38-ea1e-4656-9904-847c3ba44e49" ulx="40" uly="1182" lrx="485" lry="1221" /><zone xml:id="m-74589f82-b10f-4b6b-bbc6-379a3ff18af2" ulx="362" uly="1234" lrx="609" lry="1267" /><zone xml:id="m-28d28c35-ffd0-49b3-8625-8d8e919b2211" ulx="61" uly="1275" lrx="927" lry="1314" /><zone xml:id="m-ede3876f-8c47-47d5-9063-67e30d510f7d" ulx="40" uly="1304" lrx="924" lry="1341" /><zone xml:id="m-eb68e33b-02fc-4ce8-988e-19297da5bcfa" ulx="34" uly="1332" lrx="808" lry="1371" /><zone xml:id="m-880acc4f-05a8-4a1e-8d0d-e3146db759e2" ulx="34" uly="1358" lrx="486" lry="1397" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-764f006e-c3d3-45c1-b5c0-0387a20ced3f" n="1855" facs="#m-ec95708c-ea8d-48db-b4a2-68f2c05e6736" /><div xml:id="m-e81956a0-a5ef-44b3-9fb7-ab687c98a040">
            <lg xml:id="m-6804806e-95c2-40a8-97c2-d480d69f7480">
              <l xml:id="m-3b50311b-bb32-484b-b3b9-795ddef86843" facs="#m-492abdde-de2b-4465-abc6-34a165766672" label="ambiguous">1623</l><l xml:id="m-a5ad81d7-6dc1-413e-adbb-566d84d20593" facs="#m-d15b8e0d-3070-4bec-bb08-0d1983cd8623" label="ambiguous">September. 2.</l><l xml:id="m-4a8388df-ec9e-4fab-8b2d-b969606e1e34" facs="#m-6810ccf7-ddca-49f8-962c-c45ddaf4d78d" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Twelve Brothers, Martyrs.</l><l xml:id="m-c64bb9bb-6324-48df-bb1b-b40a843c4a9b" facs="#m-ac37aa31-921a-4c34-983c-c70a95b34239" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-28ab7ca8-dbc3-4b79-b4d7-ae89a4d7256b" facs="#m-f820a203-4c33-4a3b-ac5a-e6ae78e8f90e" label="lyrics-like">L'Ratérna nos, Dómine, Márty-¡creménta virtútum, et multiplici</l><l xml:id="m-c5df84b2-9ca1-45f8-b80c-76b93ba60c8c" facs="#m-68ba8c02-e465-4e5b-8d9c-806238a9a9e0" label="lyrics-like">F rum tuórum coróna laetificet?*l nos suffrágio consolétur. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-bbd4f3d2-2272-43a3-8bb5-b322c61b4669" facs="#m-6a252fcc-6c15-4a80-9930-1ad0e0dc5723" label="lyrics-like">quae et fidei nostrae praébeat in- minum.</l><l xml:id="m-e2ec6a3d-ffe0-44b6-8a3f-522aa4ffe327" facs="#m-35eb8712-1b08-4c68-8984-a8499b72f955" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-277c0ce7-6f1b-4106-bded-b78faaa8977d" facs="#m-d7fcfd8f-845c-4e5a-9cfe-0027369f3172" label="lyrics-like">Ystéria tua, Dómine, pro san- tractémus: quibus nobis et praesi¬</l><l xml:id="m-aa4cb40c-87e8-4285-96c9-31de9729e507" facs="#m-434f0220-775e-4a61-a455-91f348f0b23d" label="lyrics-like">ctórum Mártyrum tuórum dium crescat, et gáudium. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-8c09b10c-de29-4ef0-b288-5e8c82f92ba4" facs="#m-b59df7ce-ea9a-47ac-90a6-bc3becbb6b25" label="lyrics-like">commemoratióne devóta mente minum.</l><l xml:id="m-96101e01-3ef1-4e58-ad62-29480ef13dfb" facs="#m-e96f1ef8-cce4-46ea-ba03-8cc4c9f22b76" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-eb2b6093-1542-4bd3-9648-6232bf7e1b84" facs="#m-35d6cb8f-36dc-4247-ad9d-6aa653eb56ed" label="lyrics-like">Raesta, quaésumus, omnípotens] mus, fidem quoque proficiéndo se¬</l><l xml:id="m-e192a21e-63cc-43ab-9708-a3360d8aa0d3" facs="#m-8608f04c-0c82-4867-99d3-63b64d0e30fc" label="lyrics-like">E Deus; ut, quorum memóriam ctémur. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-dc82b692-dc5a-4a44-8fa0-8306dce8741c" facs="#m-dc181d49-a477-4102-a181-76ea612e0a2d" label="lyrics-like">sacraménti participatióne recóli¬</l><l xml:id="m-3a161d62-648e-421f-855c-94a39b10a817" facs="#m-d882a490-da30-4922-b7b3-0711ad9d6d9a" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-77b2beb0-ced7-42e8-b0fe-e588a9885c91" facs="#m-f2f3146e-db55-425e-9efd-32527ce20c9b" label="text-like">St. Stephen, King of Hungary, Conf.</l><l xml:id="m-0db17b35-eea1-436f-b388-b3cfa7684680" facs="#m-8bef163f-9fe5-4059-af38-77d3a0c41248" label="ambiguous">simple.</l><l xml:id="m-81c45cf8-2d82-4afd-b4eb-92db9388e7e7" facs="#m-3a793bb5-769e-4731-90af-064cf8640f75" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi. p. 1200, except the foltowing:</l><l xml:id="m-6aef79aa-2058-46d5-9fc5-1bb9ee10cc03" facs="#m-1d1cfe75-15d5-4aaa-b0ac-f4c6a483ee02" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-083bcbfb-be16-45f3-aae6-dc16da599d4b" facs="#m-8a39062c-b565-4379-a3f2-bb67bbeb535f" label="lyrics-like">VOncéde, quaésumus, Ecclésiae ! propagatórem hábuit, * propugna¬</l><l xml:id="m-fe7d1fb8-9e92-4d06-9306-1f78226b90f5" facs="#m-85acf987-019f-4720-8a5b-2632a236cd42" label="ambiguous">U tuae, omnipotens Deus: t ut</l><l xml:id="m-15cb8a39-cdfe-4e3d-82d8-99aacb287660" facs="#m-6e40e492-6ee0-44ea-bf7c-3322e21d28cd" label="lyrics-like">tórem habére mereátur gloriósum</l><l xml:id="m-f1bdfb2c-244c-46a0-99ec-621bb39dd0f6" facs="#m-440dfb41-8d7a-4c85-ba8a-2467ef393153" label="lyrics-like">in caelis. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-af1da24f-2709-40af-8f36-d8ebe4f46560" facs="#m-7afefa6d-5dd5-4d88-8ec2-ca5f3d4fc2bd" label="lyrics-like">beátum Stéphanum Confessórem</l><l xml:id="m-b015df94-902a-4611-9e20-06502ffb7a6b" facs="#m-cbc921da-9228-41f4-a967-b0e6b64507c2" label="lyrics-like">tuum, quem regnántem in terris</l><l xml:id="m-79df48e1-e831-4d17-a8ab-d2a66624f061" facs="#m-454452ea-6708-40cf-864f-673ff6d3f9c0" label="lyrics-like">Gospet. Homo quidam nóbilis. p. 1614.</l><l xml:id="m-4452b87f-b4cd-4ef9-97ee-90e5013dffef" facs="#m-30b307dc-b874-4fe9-8f48-2f940c2b9cb2" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-1ad1152b-7ed3-45ab-8999-d6a370e7920f" facs="#m-2bd5dcbe-9c2a-4206-89e7-28f1e1579406" label="lyrics-like">O Espice, quas offérimus, hóstias, [ria celebrámus, imitémur quod ági¬</l><l xml:id="m-4826c524-64a1-4d91-8948-67cddc5c8f4c" facs="#m-27683250-8de0-4609-b688-c0db788a8c14" label="lyrics-like">R omnipotens Deus: et praesta; ]mus. Per eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9f3f8720-3ef3-466f-8481-4130e5844fcf" facs="#m-44f8dc38-ea1e-4656-9904-847c3ba44e49" label="lyrics-like">ut, qui passiónis Dominicae mysté¬</l><l xml:id="m-547b0c71-6588-434f-b854-de9b8f61a390" facs="#m-74589f82-b10f-4b6b-bbc6-379a3ff18af2" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-3a83a929-84d2-42e5-b044-13aef4048acd" facs="#m-28d28c35-ffd0-49b3-8625-8d8e919b2211" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus, omnípotens ¡ fidei dilatatióne, de terréno regno</l><l xml:id="m-7f0d0dfd-fbb5-4ec8-b3ce-4164c0b3273d" facs="#m-ede3876f-8c47-47d5-9063-67e30d510f7d" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: ut beáti Stéphani Con-lad caeléstis regni glóriam méruit</l><l xml:id="m-30ad8271-e384-461e-8136-65e47c33d964" facs="#m-eb68e33b-02fc-4ce8-988e-19297da5bcfa" label="lyrics-like">fessóris tui fidem cóngrua devo- pervenire. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-43aae8f7-4ff6-4091-8fd0-7d2c4c143497" facs="#m-880acc4f-05a8-4a1e-8d0d-e3146db759e2" label="lyrics-like">tióne sectémur; qui pro ejúsdem</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>